\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator()</span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the negation of the argument <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<div class=\"t-member\">\n<h2 id=\"std::negate::operator.28.29\"><span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::negate::</span>operator()</h2>\n<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td><div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">T operator<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> arg <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> </td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx14\">(constexpr since C++14)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the negation of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">arg</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> arg\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> value to compute negation of\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The result of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">-</span>arg</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw implementation-defined exceptions. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Possible_implementation\">Possible implementation</h3>\n<table class=\"eq-fun-cpp-table\">\n<tr>\n<td>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> T operator<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> arg<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> \n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span>arg<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</td></tr></table>\n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Specializations","id":"Specializations"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member types","id":"Member_types"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member functions","id":"Member_functions"},{"depth":2,"text":"std::negate::operator()","id":"std::negate::operator.28.29"},{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Possible implementation","id":"Possible_implementation"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/functional","title":"Function objects"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::negate","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: until C++14, since C++14. Function object for performing negation. Effectively calls operator- on an instance of type T."},{"label":"Specializations","children":[{"label":"negate<void>","note":"function object implementing -x deducing parameter and return types"}]},{"label":"Member types","children":[{"label":"result_type (deprecated in C++17)(removed in C++20)","note":"T"},{"label":"argument_type (deprecated in C++17)(removed in C++20)","note":"T"}]},{"label":"Member functions","children":[{"label":"operator()","note":"returns the negation of the argument"}]},{"label":"std::negate::operator()","note":"Returns the negation of arg.","children":[{"label":"Parameters","note":"arg"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The result of -arg."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw implementation-defined exceptions."},{"label":"Possible implementation"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++14","C++17","C++20"],"wordCount":163,"codeBlockCount":1}
